Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.07,0:03:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第7季第16集]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.36,0:00:04.19,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.19,0:00:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些盒子被施了咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are curse boxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.77,0:00:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们封印着邪恶的魔法 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're supposed to keep the evil mojo in, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.51,0:00:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就像潘多拉宝盒 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kind of like the Pandora deal? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.77,0:00:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些是用来装受诅咒的物件的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're built to contain the power of the cursed object.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.18,0:00:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 弗兰克正在破解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, Frank's been working on the numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.59,0:00:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比用最后一口气写下的数字\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Bobby spent his last breath on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.92,0:00:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是坐标\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.07,0:00:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,指向哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}To what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.93,0:00:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,威斯康星州的一片野地\N{\fnArial\fs30}A field in Wisconsin,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.87,0:00:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚被威廉公司收购\N{\fnArial\fs30}recently purchased by Willman, inc.,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.25,0:00:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这家公司正是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}a subsidiary of…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.69,0:00:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你要赢 你就得是佼佼者\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want to win, then you got to be the shark.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.43,0:00:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,而大鱼吃小鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a shark's got to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.80,0:00:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,理查德·罗曼企业旗下的子公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Richard Roman enterprises.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.67,0:00:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们正准备建个什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're getting ready to build something.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.99,0:00:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要建什么 - 问得好 建什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Build what? - Exactly. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.67,0:00:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是个绝世怪物 但我能控制得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a grade-A freak, but I'm managing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.03,0:00:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在绝对有什么不同了 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's definitely different now, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.86,0:00:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你让我进去了 - 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You let me in. - Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.30,0:00:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对我说「闭嘴」了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said "Shut up" to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.72,0:00:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你以为还能用你小小的伎俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you think you can use your little tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.49,0:00:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,再这么赶走我吗 不行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}to banish me again, like that? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.65,0:00:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确信我搞定你了 铺友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do believe I've got you, bunk buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.59,0:00:51.12,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.03,0:00:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊琳娜又没来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No Irina again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.92,0:00:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,她名气太大 我们不配和她一起练习\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess she's too famous for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.58,0:01:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 她只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, she just…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.34,0:01:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,「香」独自练习\N{\fnArial\fs30}"vants" to be alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.78,0:01:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊琳娜 现在练功有点晚吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Irina. A little late for practice, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.75,0:01:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远不会太晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.98,0:01:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,熟能生巧嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Practice makes perfect…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.92,0:01:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,前提是你得有那天赋\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you have the talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.79,0:03:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪克在资助一个考古挖掘项目吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Dick's funding an archaeological dig?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.20,0:03:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非迪克是想把自己挖出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, unless Dick's actually digging himself,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.36,0:03:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真不知这消息对我有啥用 弗兰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure I know what to do with that, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.76,0:03:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有他在沙特阿拉伯的工厂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or the factory in Saudi Arabia,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.86,0:03:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,和雅加达的渔场\N{\fnArial\fs30}or the fishery in Jakarta.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.93,0:03:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些都没啥用啊 弗兰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of this is helping, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.25,0:03:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,从西方世界到东南亚是多大的范围啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Explain how Western to Southeast Asia is too wide a net.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.96,0:03:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本可去特罗姆瑟避难\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I could be in Tromso right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.45,0:03:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,特罗姆瑟就没有利维坦活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zero Leviathan activity in Tromso.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.93,0:03:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,特罗姆瑟在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell is Tromso?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.09,0:03:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,在挪威 你这蠢蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Norway, you moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.48,0:03:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便说一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.24,0:03:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在比尤特又开了一家比格森连锁店\N{\fnArial\fs30}they opened another Biggerson in Butte.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.16,0:03:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了 但我们不在蒙塔纳州\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, we're not in Montana.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.69,0:03:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不容易 你知道比尤特在哪 真欣慰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you know where butte is. That's encouraging.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.87,0:03:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你们在哪呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.97,0:03:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们在俄勒冈呢 - 不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're in Oregon. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.04,0:03:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在俄勒冈什么都没查到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got nothing in Oregon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.58,0:03:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,威斯康星啊 弗兰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wisconsin, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.69,0:03:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.83,0:03:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些坐标啊 鲍比给咱们的坐标\N{\fnArial\fs30}The coordinates … Bobby's coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.38,0:03:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.66,0:03:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,想起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.56,0:04:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 没啥东西 没动静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, no. I got nothing. I got no activity.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.24,0:04:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就再查查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, work on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.33,0:04:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你啥时候成我老大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. When did you become the boss of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.60,0:04:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是看不上我干的活\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't like what I'm doing,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.54,0:04:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就给我去死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can stick it right up your Montana.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.08,0:04:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 好了 有话好好说 弗兰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, all right, all right. Take it easy, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.96,0:04:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 还有件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and another thing …
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.69,0:04:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰克 喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank? Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.87,0:04:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fr…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.40,0:04:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个疯老头\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a crazy son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.94,0:04:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是说弗兰克吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.87,0:04:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,向一个暴躁的疑心病求助\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, having a cranky total paranoid as your go-to guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.97,0:04:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's … it's…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.50,0:04:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不知道该咋说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.68,0:04:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是干吗 要打破喝咖啡的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, are you going for, like, the Guinness record.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.08,0:04:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉尼斯纪录吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}of caffeine consumption?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.53,0:04:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你今早第五杯了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's like your fifth this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.04,0:04:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,每当我一闭眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, every time I close my eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.99,0:04:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西法就冲我大喊大叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer is yelling into my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.65,0:04:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,就好像我放他进来一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like I let him in once,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.97,0:04:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,就再也无法摆脱\N{\fnArial\fs30}now I can't get rid of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.21,0:04:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他并不是真的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know he's not actually…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.83,0:04:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 对 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, no. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.16,0:04:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这话跟我脑袋里的音量控制开关说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, try telling that to the volume control inside my brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.05,0:04:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没再试试掐伤口那招\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, did you try the hand thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.51,0:04:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,试了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.79,0:04:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正我现在清醒 看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, long as I'm awake, check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.15,0:04:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,报道说是嗑药了 但你看看言外之意\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're saying drugs, but read between the lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.19,0:04:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,她好像把自己的脚跳掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like she danced her own feet off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.22,0:04:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,有可能是咱们的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might be our kind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.50,0:04:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,舞蹈演员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dancers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.60,0:04:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿着芭蕾舞鞋的疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are toe shoes full of crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.52,0:05:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…你怎么会有了解呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You … and you would know this how?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.83,0:05:01.95,Title,0,0,0,0,,我看过《黑天鹅》\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw "Black Swan",
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.93,0:05:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,看了两回呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.86,0:05:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,激情四射的女同表演\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hot tutu-on-tutu action?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.41,0:05:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了吧 萨姆 你什么毛病啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Sam. What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.54,0:05:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可真有深度啊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The depths of your…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.70,0:05:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就在波特兰 几小时车程\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, it's in Portland, a couple hours away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.30,0:05:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.08,0:05:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 舞者嘛 何乐不为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, dancers. Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.61,0:05:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定你在路上还能睡一觉呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you'll get some sleep on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.36,0:05:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.68,0:05:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟平常一样 没电磁干扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, the usual … no EMF,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.28,0:05:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,没硫磺 没有巫蛊的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}no sulfur, no hex junk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.33,0:05:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这趟见不到几个舞者\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there's no more dancers to interview on this trip,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.58,0:05:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就白跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it could be a bust,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.55,0:05:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我听说波特兰的咖啡不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}although I hear they have good coffee in Portland.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.54,0:05:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 那是西雅图\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, that's Seattle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.80,0:05:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们还是先干正事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, let's just get the drill over with.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.01,0:05:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.86,0:05:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想看看伊琳娜·考甘赞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, we'd like to see the crime-scene photos.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.79,0:05:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡现场的照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the Irina Koganzon case, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.48,0:05:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you would be…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.69,0:06:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.18,0:06:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不急\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.88,0:06:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 你可不能碰这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you can't touch those, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.90,0:06:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是爸爸工作用的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are for daddy's work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.11,0:06:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.11,0:06:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想上厕所\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to go pee.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.56,0:06:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 你知道厕所在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweetie, you know where the little girls' room is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.32,0:07:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 是挺奇怪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'd call that weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.69,0:07:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, there. How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.25,0:07:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你们想干吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. What can I do for you fellas?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.11,0:07:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要看芭蕾舞蹈演员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we need to see the shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.31,0:07:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,死时候穿的那双鞋\N{\fnArial\fs30}that were involved in the ballet dancer's death.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.57,0:07:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,没想到联调局会管这案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't figure that would be an FBI deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.36,0:07:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题 鞋就在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}But sure. Yeah, right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.44,0:08:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼 翠西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, Tracy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.87,0:08:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁是翠西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's Tracy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.95,0:08:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}My daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.62,0:08:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,她超爱芭蕾\N{\fnArial\fs30}She loves ballet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.62,0:08:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,快把那鞋脱掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, take those shoes off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.06,0:08:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 快拿鞋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, get the shoes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.55,0:08:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在弄啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.04,0:08:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.07,0:08:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.07,0:08:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在脱啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.31,0:08:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.98,0:08:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.91,0:08:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.65,0:08:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这肯定是受诅咒的物件\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going with cursed object.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.55,0:08:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,还用说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.47,0:08:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.06,0:08:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一站 旧的不去 新的不来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next stop … Out with the old.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.97,0:08:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们不能奢望这双鞋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose it's too much to hope that these shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.86,0:09:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是店里唯一的危险物品吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}are the only thing in that store that we have to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.91,0:09:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是天真的可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, what a dreamer you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.07,0:09:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们不是把鞋放在后备箱了么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't we put those in the trunk?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.92,0:09:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是怎么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}H-how did they …
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.92,0:09:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,受诅咒的物件啊 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cursed object, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.46,0:09:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这好像是你的鞋号啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do they…look like they're… your size?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.55,0:09:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.51,0:09:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, a-are you …
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.15,0:09:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一种要忘我舞蹈的冲动吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Getting the strong urge to Prince Siegfried myself into oblivion?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.33,0:09:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.13,0:09:45.60,Title,0,0,0,0,,你还真看过《黑天鹅》啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really did see "Black Swan."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.25,0:09:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴能跟你见面 马修先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it was nice seeing you, Mr. Marshall.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.61,0:09:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果对我们的提议有疑问尽管打给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please call me if you have any questions about the offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.33,0:09:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想好会联系你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll let you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.98,0:10:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他不会卖的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think he's gonna sell.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.81,0:10:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,思考不是你的强项 乔治\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thinking is not your strong suit, George.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.31,0:10:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔治\N{\fnArial\fs30}George?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.09,0:10:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}The door.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.47,0:10:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.00,0:10:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你卖的么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, did you sell these?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.71,0:10:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.95,0:10:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从哪弄来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you get them?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.83,0:10:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈把它们放在那盒子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, m-my m-mother had them in that box.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.43,0:10:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand. What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.52,0:11:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个吗 这里面的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This, in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.52,0:11:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Geez!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.30,0:11:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧 巴瑞辛尼科夫（芭蕾舞传奇巨星）\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay there, Baryshnikov?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.13,0:11:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.45,0:11:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好 我「还好」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm "pas de done."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.73,0:11:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不太麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, if it's not too much trouble,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.08,0:11:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们能告诉我这是怎么回事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}do you mind telling me, uh, what's … what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.41,0:11:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.61,0:11:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯考特 斯考特·弗里曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Scott … uh, Scott Freeman.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.31,0:11:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说这些是你妈的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said these were your mother's?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.11,0:11:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,她从哪里弄到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd she get them?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.36,0:11:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 我在后面找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I found them in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.67,0:11:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.25,0:11:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你母亲现在在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, where is your mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.73,0:11:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,她 她上周去世了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, she's, uh…she passed away last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.44,0:11:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,节哀顺变\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.26,0:11:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 斯考特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scott, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.06,0:11:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这双鞋子\N{\fnArial\fs30}These shoes…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.52,0:11:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过是她收集的一些私人物品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just some personal stuff she collected.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.49,0:11:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在想办法都给卖掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to get rid of it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.38,0:11:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,都 还有其他类似物品吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}All? Is there more like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.15,0:11:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.66,0:11:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯考特 那些盒子里原来有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scott, what was in those boxes?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.62,0:13:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你们是哪门子联调局探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, what the hell kind of FBI guys are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.05,0:13:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,为你收拾烂摊子的那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kind that are trying to fix the mess you started.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.92,0:13:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈妈在哪里弄到这些的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now where'd your mom get these?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.12,0:13:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 我在她的保险柜里找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I found them in her safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.07,0:13:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就从没想过这些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did it ever occur to you that these things.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.55,0:13:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,被锁在保险柜里可能是有原因的\N{\fnArial\fs30}might be locked in that safe for a reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.62,0:13:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我以为那不过是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I just thought it was some of the junk.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.61,0:13:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,她多年来收集的破烂\N{\fnArial\fs30}that she had collected over the years.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.40,0:13:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道她喜欢古怪的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, I knew she was into some weird stuff,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.97,0:13:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我从来不知道她会\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I never thought that she would be, like …
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.77,0:13:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该好好考虑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, think again, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.44,0:13:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这些「破烂」在杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause this "junk" is killing people.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.78,0:13:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 怎么可能 - 听着 斯考特\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? Like, how can that be? - Look, Scott.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.44,0:13:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得知道你到底卖出了保险箱里的什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna need to know exactly what you sold out of that safe,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.72,0:13:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及买家的姓名和地址\N{\fnArial\fs30}and names and addresses of who you sold it to.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.79,0:13:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 这个人是什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, what do we got?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.28,0:13:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,她买了一只茶壶\N{\fnArial\fs30}She bought a tea kettle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.11,0:13:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 茶壶 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tea kettle? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.89,0:13:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果巫术够厉害 一只铅笔也能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, with enough curse mojo, you can turn a freaking pencil.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.55,0:14:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,变成大规模杀伤性武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}into a weapon of mass destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.07,0:14:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,流年不利啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good times.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.04,0:14:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好打电话报案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better call this in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.76,0:14:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.69,0:14:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,格汉姆大街23号发生了一起事故\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to report an accident at 23 Gorham Road.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.32,0:14:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.75,0:14:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是布鲁斯·宏斯比（知名音乐人）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruce Hornsby.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.62,0:14:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 下一个是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Who's next on the list?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.53,0:14:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,购买留声机的布兰达·格拉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a, uh, gramophone sold to Brenda Gluck,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.60,0:14:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,住在小河街413号\N{\fnArial\fs30}413 River Street,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.74,0:14:51.02,Title,0,0,0,0,,以及购买旧《绅士杂志》的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a vintage Gentleman's Magazine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.02,0:14:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得·杨吉特 住在约翰逊巷27号\N{\fnArial\fs30}sold to Peter Yankit, 27 Johnson Lane.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.26,0:14:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是吧 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.83,0:14:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们分头行动吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we'd better split up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.77,0:14:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去解决留声机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you take the gramophone?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.69,0:14:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我着手对付旧色情杂志\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll handle the old rag.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.60,0:15:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我是你 可不会真的「着手」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't really "handle" it if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.18,0:15:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得那双鞋吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember those shoes?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.29,0:15:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 怎么可能忘记\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, how could I forget?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.78,0:15:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知旧色情杂志是怎么杀人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I wonder how old porn kills you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.27,0:15:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定不会想知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty sure you don't want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.73,0:15:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你大概是对的 好了 出发 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, you're probably right. All right. Let's do this. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.39,0:15:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把这些搬上楼 马上回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna run these upstairs. Be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.92,0:15:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒂姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Timmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.91,0:15:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒂姆 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Timmy, come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.15,0:16:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要告诉你个秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a secret for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.58,0:16:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 蒂姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Psst. Timmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.98,0:16:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.68,0:16:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒂姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Timmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.72,0:16:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒂姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Timmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.26,0:16:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒂姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Timmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.91,0:17:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,留声机在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the gramophone?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.58,0:17:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动 那是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. That's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.67,0:17:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子 你正好借此机会知道什么叫感恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kid, this would be a really good time for a lesson in gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.86,0:17:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,算你走运 我累了不想揍人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucky for you, I'm too tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.25,0:17:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到色情杂志了 很及时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got the porn. Just in time, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.87,0:17:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他做什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.07,0:17:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你说的 你不会想知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, like you said, you don't want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.60,0:17:59.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你进展如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you at?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.68,0:18:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚找到留声机\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just got the gramophone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.19,0:18:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,在小镇另一头 我去找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm across town. I'll head your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.26,0:18:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说我妈妈不是疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}So my mom wasn't just some whack job.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.02,0:18:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些东西全是真格的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All this stuff is real?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.73,0:18:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.55,0:18:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真是太歉疚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now I-I really feel like crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.25,0:18:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}How come?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.61,0:18:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直敦促她卖掉小店\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well I kept pushing her to sell the store.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.51,0:18:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,她总是不同意 而我继续催她\N{\fnArial\fs30}She kept saying no, and I kept pushing her,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.63,0:18:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟她说能赚多少钱什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know, telling her how much money she'd make.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.15,0:18:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为你让她改变想法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you changed her mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.54,0:18:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.86,0:18:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,有位房地产公司的女士总来找她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, this real-estate lady kept coming around,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.91,0:18:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来有一天 妈妈突然就同意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then one day, just like that, mom says okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.66,0:18:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后她就出了事故\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then she had that accident,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.81,0:18:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至来不及享福\N{\fnArial\fs30}never even got to enjoy the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.20,0:18:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,事隔多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}How soon after?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.94,0:18:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,就第二天\N{\fnArial\fs30}The next day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.02,0:18:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,她怎么死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did she die?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.25,0:18:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,车祸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Car crash.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.36,0:19:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在想 如果我没有催她 那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I keep thinking, if I hadn't pushed her, then…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.17,0:19:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, a little tip.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.64,0:19:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,内疚也无法让死者复生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feeling guilty ain't gonna bring 'em back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.91,0:19:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只能好好生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best you can do is live your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.62,0:19:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她为你骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}the way that you think would make her proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.96,0:19:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少别丢尽她的脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or at least not embarrass the crap out of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.71,0:19:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道该怎么做吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the drill, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.45,0:19:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰箱子里的任何东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't touch anything in those boxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.77,0:19:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 你都不要靠近那个保险箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, don't even go near the safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.36,0:19:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把那些东西都装好箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once we get it all boxed up,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.50,0:19:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,就叫辆货车来把它们都运走\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll get a U-Haul and get everything out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.79,0:19:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 我懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me, I… I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.44,0:19:49.20,Note,0,0,0,0,,（已售 碧科比地产）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.49,0:19:57.17,Note,0,0,0,0,,（已售 碧科比地产）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.06,0:19:59.16,Note,0,0,0,0,,（已售 碧科比地产）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.79,0:20:03.14,Note,0,0,0,0,,（已售 碧科比地产）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.05,0:20:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,马修先生 这个街区会大变样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Mr. Marshall, the block won't be the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.35,0:20:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你大部分邻居都已经卖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most of your neighbors have already sold.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.41,0:20:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为你准备了一份分析报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I've prepared an analysis report for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.56,0:20:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔治\N{\fnArial\fs30}George?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.43,0:20:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是这份 乔治 马修先生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not this one, George. Mr. Marshall's.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.80,0:20:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今要找个好帮手真心不容易啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hard to find good help these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.41,0:20:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 正如你所见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, as you can see,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.34,0:20:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的报价已经相当慷慨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}our offer is more than generous.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.51,0:20:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.67,0:20:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,有了这一大笔钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}And with that generous offer,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.83,0:20:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你几乎可以随心所欲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can pretty much go wherever and do whatever you please.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.27,0:21:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以继续好好生活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can get on with your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.00,0:21:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,碧科比小姐 我今晚来这\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Miss Bicklebee, I came here tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.40,0:21:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,本来是要卖掉那间铺子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}with every intention of selling.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.70,0:21:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你刚才说什么继续好好生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what you just said, about getting on with my life…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.60,0:21:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那间铺子就是我的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}That store is my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.79,0:21:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能卖\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't sell.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.38,0:21:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都对过去恋恋不舍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we all feel attached to our past,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.06,0:21:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但未来才是真正的冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's the future that's the real adventure, and…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.85,0:21:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我不卖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, not sellin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.60,0:21:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不买你那套 女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I ain't buyin' that crap either, lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.36,0:21:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是拿定了主意 我也没办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if that's your decision, what can I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.73,0:21:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你余生好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish you the best of luck with the rest of your life…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.03,0:21:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜你时日无多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}what little there is left of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.26,0:22:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到没\N{\fnArial\fs30}See?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.71,0:22:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,如预期的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}As promised…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.81,0:22:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,买到手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the dotted line.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.99,0:22:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.63,0:22:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是太急着杀人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you were a little quick on the trigger?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.00,0:22:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,先是古董店的女人 现在又是这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}First the woman at the antique shop, and now this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.46,0:22:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道罗曼先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you know that Mr. Roman.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.56,0:22:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不喜欢我们太招眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}doesn't like us calling attention to ourselves…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.09,0:22:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该怎么处理尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what should I do with the body?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.82,0:22:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 这态度就对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There. That's the attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.09,0:22:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.98,0:22:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,把马修先生和他难闻的雪茄送回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take Mr. Marshall and his stinky cigar home.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.73,0:22:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他放在床上\N{\fnArial\fs30}and put them in bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.05,0:22:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 乔治\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. And, George?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.51,0:22:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,确保雪茄点燃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make sure the cigar is lit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.92,0:23:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧得火热\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, burning hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.30,0:23:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,马修先生死了 他应该戒烟的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There goes Mr. Marshall. Should've quit smoking.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.51,0:23:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸烟有害健康\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can be hazardous to your health.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.52,0:23:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道自我占据这副身体以来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know how many assistants I've had.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.01,0:23:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,换过多少助理吗 乔治\N{\fnArial\fs30}since taking this body, George?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.47,0:23:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概三个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe three?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.01,0:23:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,五个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.69,0:23:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自行想象前四个的下场吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I leave it to your imagination what happened to the first four.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.91,0:23:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,咖啡煮得不好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was something wrong with the brew?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.63,0:23:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说呢 我要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell me. What did I ask for?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.61,0:23:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,一杯热咖啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hot cup of coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.15,0:23:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 咖啡的部分说对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right. Got the coffee part.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.26,0:23:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我说「热的」\N{\fnArial\fs30}But did I say "hot",
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.27,0:23:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是「温的」呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}or, I don't know, "tepid"?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.69,0:24:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,有四个前车之鉴 乔治 随口说说罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four, George. Just saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.32,0:24:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,去主街的咖啡师那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So go to that nice barista on main.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.57,0:24:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我买一杯大杯的脱脂无奶油白摩卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}and get me a grande non-fat no-whip white mocha,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.61,0:24:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,一泵无糖糖浆 双份特浓 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}one pump sugar-free, double-shot espresso, 'kay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.51,0:24:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.48,0:24:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那家店在镇子的另一头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, t-that's all the way across town.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.90,0:24:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要九点才能回来 - 好 8点45见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I won't be back till 9:00. - Okay. See you at 8:45.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.17,0:24:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.02,0:24:51.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.05,0:24:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在还不能把保险箱带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, not sure we're taking the safe out of town just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.85,0:24:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给你 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here you go. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.16,0:24:59.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来并不是囤积症妈妈百年之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, so, it turns out that mama hoarder didn't just die.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.33,0:25:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯考特继承了小店\N{\fnArial\fs30}and leave the store to Scott.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.03,0:25:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She didn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.91,0:25:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是的 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, listen to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.52,0:25:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,她四十年来一直想留住小店\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lady spends 40 years trying to keep that place, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.57,0:25:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后有一天她醒来就答应卖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then one day she wakes up and sells.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.10,0:25:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二天就开车坠崖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next day, drives her car off a cliff.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.76,0:25:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 你觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh… what, you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.25,0:25:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人割断了她的刹车吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}somebody cut her brakes or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.66,0:25:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我觉得世界真是充满了搞笑的巧合\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I think the world is full of hilarious coincidences.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.65,0:25:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外还有个新公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and there's this new company …
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.81,0:25:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,听都没听过 做房地产的\N{\fnArial\fs30}never even tasted real estate,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.83,0:25:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,把主街上的店面都要买光了\N{\fnArial\fs30}just gobbled up a huge chunk of main street.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.85,0:25:25.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在下结论可能有点草率\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I could be off the deep end here,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.38,0:25:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你不觉得奇怪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}but doesn't that seem weird to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.34,0:25:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.92,0:25:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.79,0:25:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,对对对 听起来不错 保持联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, yeah. sounds good. Keep me posted.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.00,0:25:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds good?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.46,0:25:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.55,0:25:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人说过 不许人睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, they said, um, sleep deprivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.51,0:25:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是一种「强大的审讯手段」 - 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- is an "enhanced interrogation technique"? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.31,0:25:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 这根本就是酷刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me, it's torture.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.03,0:25:56.63,Note,0,0,0,0,,（抱歉 该网站无法访问）
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.74,0:25:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.35,0:26:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,找我最好有好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This better be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.54,0:26:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰克 我倒是不想让你更加凌乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank, hey, I don't mean to double-dip in your crazy sauce.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.46,0:26:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没别的意思 - 没事 你个软蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No offense. - None taken, fudge pop.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.97,0:26:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可能有发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I think I found something.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.12,0:26:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不说话就是等着你说 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}My silence is your cue, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.07,0:26:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,波特兰这边有家新公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so, there's this new company.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.32,0:26:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,正大举买下这边的小买卖\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's buying up a whole bunch of Mom and Pop's in Portland.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.73,0:26:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我在登陆公司网站时被防火墙挡住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I hit a firewall when I tried to access its site.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.17,0:26:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该能破解吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think you can crack it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.27,0:26:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得狗会玩扑克吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can a dog play poker?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.87,0:26:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.59,0:26:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然可以 给我公司名称\N{\fnArial\fs30}The answer is yes. What's the company name?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.16,0:26:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,兴隆地产股份有限公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, GEOTHRIVE, Inc.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.46,0:27:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.14,0:27:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过只要一泵无糖糖浆 不是两泵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said one pump sugar-free, not two.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.39,0:27:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一泵是免费送的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Extra pump's on the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.12,0:27:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢好意 但是我老板尝得出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's very nice, but my boss is gonna be able to tell, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.79,0:27:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你重新给我做一杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}So please just make me a new one.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.22,0:27:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么多人在排队 只有我一人在忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's people in line, and I'm here all alone, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.22,0:27:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好享用这泵免费糖浆吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enjoy the free pump.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.13,0:27:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是给我重做一杯吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about make me a new one?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.68,0:27:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你吃了我得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about you eat me?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.32,0:27:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,别逼我啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't tempt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.75,0:28:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你走运了 我现在迟到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'are Lucky I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.36,0:28:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,超级走运\N{\fnArial\fs30}So lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.44,0:28:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.26,0:28:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要份三倍超浓咖啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I get a, uh, a-a triple red-eye, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.15,0:28:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不要命了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.99,0:28:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说些什么呢 乔治\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about, George?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.98,0:28:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要的咖啡呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's my coffee?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.17,0:28:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说真的 没开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am seriously, not kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.66,0:28:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定那是他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're sure it's him?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.22,0:28:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.32,0:28:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆·温彻斯特正迈进我们刚买下的古董店\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam Winchester is going into that antique shop we just bought.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.76,0:28:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得他们是来找我们的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y-you think they're here for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.39,0:28:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会 相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.95,0:28:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果温家兄弟是来找我们的 我们会知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the Winchesters were here for us, we'd know.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.84,0:28:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肯定会很享受这个的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am going to enjoy this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.26,0:28:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,享受 享受什么 乔治\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enjoy? Enjoy what, George?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.55,0:28:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我要吃掉他吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…eating him is pretty much what I was thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.66,0:28:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.74,0:28:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不行 - 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! - No?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.23,0:28:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快回办公室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come back to the office.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.53,0:28:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.15,0:28:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是有管理系统的 乔治\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a chain of command here, George.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.69,0:29:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到哪个温家兄弟了 你不能吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see a Winchester, you don't eat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.10,0:29:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得告诉我 我来吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell me, and I eat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.17,0:29:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么想的 我还能告诉迪克\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think, I'm gonna tell Dick,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.93,0:29:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,「他可能吃了他 但我没看到过程」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I think he ate him, but I didn't see it"?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.48,0:29:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要我给你作担保吗 乔治\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, I'm supposed to vouch for you, George?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.08,0:29:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再干件蠢事就该自噬谢罪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you're not one dumb move away from a bibbing already?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.52,0:29:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.53,0:29:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I …
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.24,0:29:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.75,0:29:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但是 - 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But… - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.24,0:29:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许顶嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no, no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.67,0:29:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是两泵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two pumps.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.46,0:29:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧 乔治\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really, George?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.87,0:29:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰克 是不是有发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank, tell me you got something.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.02,0:29:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打电话是告诉你湖人对凯尔特的比分\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm calling with the Lakers-Celtics score.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.37,0:29:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.96,0:29:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然是有发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Course I got something.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.13,0:30:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你为什么被防火墙拦下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figured out why you hit that firewall.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.20,0:30:07.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰克 我不说话就是等着你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}My silence is your cue, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.09,0:30:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,真会说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, touche?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.08,0:30:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要进入兴隆地产的内部网络\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you were trying to access the GEOTHRIVE internal site,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.81,0:30:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,之所以进不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the reason why you couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.74,0:30:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为只要挖得够深\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause if you dig down deep,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.75,0:30:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,总是迪克在搞鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's all Dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.99,0:30:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这倒是挺有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, that'd be helpful.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.71,0:30:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是你什么事都往他身上扯\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you didn't say that about everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.15,0:30:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 但我这里有真凭实据 机灵鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, except I'm operating on hard fact now, wise-ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.65,0:30:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说兴隆地产是罗曼公司一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're tellin' me that GEOTHRIVE is part of Roman, Inc.?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.31,0:30:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这个联合企业中一个子公司的联合企业\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a conglomerate within a subsidiary within a conglomerate.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.64,0:30:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,都联系在一起了 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all tied together, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.30,0:30:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这算怎么回事 利维坦现在收购起小买卖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay so what, Leviathans are Walmart-ting mom-'n'-pops?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.58,0:30:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,回答正确加十分\N{\fnArial\fs30}And bingo was his name-o. Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.27,0:30:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么威斯康星州有片荒地\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we've got a big ol' field in Wisconsin.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.01,0:30:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,波特兰又整了一堆小店\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a bunch of friggin' shops in Portland?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.86,0:30:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这帮人要干嘛啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are they up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.04,0:30:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beats me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.26,0:30:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只知道它隶属迪克的公司而且绝对有蹊跷\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I know is it's corporate and smelly as the day is long.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.26,0:30:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要是你 我就立马开溜\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I were you, I'd get out of dodge, pronto.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.06,0:30:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里在出人命 弗兰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}People are dying here, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.28,0:30:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,每秒钟都有人死 去查肥胖症统计数据吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, every second. Check the obesity stats.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.47,0:30:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个小镇没啥特别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That town ain't nothin' special.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.60,0:31:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还不能离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we're not done here, okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.10,0:31:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定能查到什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, hey, we might get some answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.72,0:31:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.34,0:31:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,有命活下来再打给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call me if you don't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.71,0:31:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么样 - 这辆就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So? - Well, that'll work.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.23,0:31:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, how's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.52,0:31:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚跟弗兰克通过电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just got off the phone with Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.15,0:31:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这镇上有利维坦在作怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, we have a bit of a leviathan issue in this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.10,0:31:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这里有利维坦 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Leviathan, here? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.41,0:31:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个迪克那样的老怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're lookin' at a big, old giant nesting doll of Dick,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.94,0:31:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,在地产销售界混呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}as far as property sales go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.60,0:31:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着我说话没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you hearing me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.39,0:31:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着了 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, yeah, yeah. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.59,0:31:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 别再搞什么不睡觉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you know what? Enough with the insomnia crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.40,0:31:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着没 你得睡一觉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, pacino? You need to crash.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.49,0:31:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我继续工作 你找个汽车旅馆睡一觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll keep working. You find a motel and get some sleep. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.51,0:31:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我干嘛都没有 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter what I do, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.52,0:31:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西法就是不闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer will not shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.87,0:31:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在也是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even now?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.07,0:31:57.21,Title,0,0,0,0,,他正在唱《天国的阶梯》\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's singing "stairway to heaven" right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.06,0:31:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好歌啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good song.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.65,0:32:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,连听五十次就吐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not 50 times in a row.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.04,0:32:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 斯考特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Scott.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.70,0:32:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你 萨姆 你得帮帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, Sam. Y-you got to help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.78,0:32:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,出什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.38,0:32:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看了一眼我妈妈的一个旧镜子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I looked in one of my mom's old mirrors,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.75,0:32:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我想把自己的脸扯下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now I want to rip my face off!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.79,0:32:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好像中了诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it was cursed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.12,0:32:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 淡定 我们就来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, hold tight. We're on our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.47,0:32:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.05,0:32:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他碰了不该碰的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}He touched something he was not supposed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.62,0:32:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须的\N{\fnArial\fs30}'course he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.11,0:32:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.39,0:32:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样可以了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was that okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.53,0:32:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然够不上奥斯卡影帝的水准\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, not exactly Oscar-worthy, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.47,0:32:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过也令人信服\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I was convinced.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.03,0:32:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这不要紧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that it matters,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.05,0:32:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再没话可说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}because you don't have any more lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.96,0:32:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.67,0:32:57.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在等着食物上门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we wait for meal service.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.64,0:33:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样一来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.15,0:33:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们又有一具尸体需要处理了\N{\fnArial\fs30}one more body we're gonna have to spirit away, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.38,0:33:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上 不可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.23,0:33:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,正如你先前指出的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you so helpfully pointed out earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.27,0:33:22.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪克不喜欢有事见报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dick doesn't like making the papers.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.78,0:33:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 那我们怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, right, so what's the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.55,0:33:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,总不能留下斯考特到处宣扬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we can't have Scott here running his mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.68,0:33:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,大嘴一张 什么都说出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loose lips, yada, yada, yada.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.53,0:33:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.66,0:33:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过别人倒不非得知道他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that doesn't mean anyone ever has to notice he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.96,0:33:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,收拾东西 乔治\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pack your bags, Georgie.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.05,0:33:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要变成斯考特·弗里曼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are turning into one Scott Freeman.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.56,0:33:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,要做上三十几年的\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the next, oh, 30-some-odd years.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.36,0:33:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是 斯考特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, Scotty?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.23,0:34:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来没有受诅咒的镜子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So much for the cursed mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.94,0:34:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆和迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam and Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.85,0:34:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴认识二位\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is such a pleasure to make your acquaintances.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.39,0:34:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了让你们知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, just so you can put names to the faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.15,0:34:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,要吃掉你们的人是谁 我是乔伊斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}that will be eating you, I'm Joyce,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.69,0:34:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我助理 乔治\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is my assistant, George.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.19,0:34:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you're the …
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.15,0:34:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是地产公司广告牌上的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're the lady from the real-estate signs.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.63,0:34:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 喜欢我的玉照吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. You like my photo?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.30,0:34:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是少用点亮白牙线吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you might want to lay off the whitening strips.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.73,0:34:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.40,0:34:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会相当享受把你从牙缝里剔出去的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am gonna enjoy picking you out of my teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.73,0:35:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边有一桶你们喜欢往我们身上泼的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a bucket of that stuff that you love throwing at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.88,0:35:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,就那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.35,0:35:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,趁她没看见 把我按在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dunk me, before she sees.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.91,0:35:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.49,0:35:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.46,0:35:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.74,0:36:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这些东西不是闹着玩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I get that these things mean business, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.33,0:36:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我不能抬脚就走啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can't just, like, uproot my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.06,0:36:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.84,0:36:14.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,没你想的那么难\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not as hard as you'd think.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.73,0:36:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 斯考特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Scott.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.17,0:36:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些大嘴怪从不留活口\N{\fnArial\fs30}These big mouths don't like to leave loose ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.11,0:36:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你就一直跑 别回头\N{\fnArial\fs30}So don't you look back till you get someplace.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.88,0:36:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到你走到语言不通的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}where you don't speak the language.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.94,0:36:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我这就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.08,0:36:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想该谢谢你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, thank you, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.90,0:36:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,别客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't mention it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.62,0:36:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你一分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}One minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.20,0:36:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,解释你为什么帮我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how long you have to explain to us why you helped us.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.35,0:36:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我特别想知道那婆娘什么滋味\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I am dying to know what that bitch tastes like.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.18,0:36:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,容我理理清 你想吃了你上司\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, let me get this straight. You want to eat your boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.49,0:36:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有更好的办法阻止她满血复活吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a better way to make her stay dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.21,0:37:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 你现在是我们这边的了还是咋的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what? So now you're on our side or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.09,0:37:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.65,0:37:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.21,0:37:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,可乔伊斯要是不死\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if Joyce is alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.00,0:37:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我余生都要收拾她的烂摊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}then I spend the rest of my life cleaning her messes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.98,0:37:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者更惨 被她吃掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or worse, I get eaten.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.86,0:37:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者自噬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or bibbed.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.72,0:37:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以谢谢二位\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, thanks…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.95,0:37:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,替我把她的头砍下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}for chopping her head off for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.56,0:37:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,单独对付她可不好办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taking her on solo … yikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.55,0:37:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的感谢二位帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, really, thanks for the assist there.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.59,0:37:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 不用谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, of course, you're welcome…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.13,0:37:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我救了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}for saving you…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.10,0:37:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不至被她像圣诞礼物那样撕碎\N{\fnArial\fs30}before she ripped into your ass like a christmas present.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.19,0:37:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,双赢 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Win-win, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.82,0:37:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.23,0:37:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的头能给我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}how 'bout that head?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.50,0:37:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,没门 乔治\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, not gonna happen, Georgie.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.79,0:37:51.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.94,0:37:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪克·罗曼到底在威斯康星建什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is Dick Roman building in Wisconsin?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.41,0:37:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.45,0:37:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不知道威斯康星是什么鬼地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I barely know where Wisconsin is.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.53,0:38:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是西海岸的代表\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a west-coast representative.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.96,0:38:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还会再杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna keep killing people.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.84,0:38:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不肯卖房的人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}who don't sign on the dotted line?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.60,0:38:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 别紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.09,0:38:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀人不在计划之内\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killing people isn't part of the agenda.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.85,0:38:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔伊斯就是有点不耐烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joyce just kept getting impatient.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.67,0:38:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不用担心我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got nothing to worry about with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.09,0:38:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.81,0:38:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们紧张错了地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys are freaking out about the wrong thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.94,0:38:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.55,0:38:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,买房卖房这点小事\N{\fnArial\fs30}A couple of real-estate deals?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.87,0:38:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,着眼大局啊 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Big picture, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.79,0:38:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为只有这里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y-you think it's just here?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.92,0:38:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到处买地\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.49,0:38:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且比这个小计划要宏伟的多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's a lot more ambitious than this little project.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.75,0:38:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我建议二位低调些 别出头\N{\fnArial\fs30}My advice … keep your heads down and stay down.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.95,0:38:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好了 你个黏糊糊的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me, you gooey son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.96,0:38:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我们你们在这里建什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna tell us what you're building here,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.00,0:38:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不我就用那个给你漱口\N{\fnArial\fs30}or I'm gonna wash your mouth out with soap.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.45,0:38:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还想大家有话好好说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I was hoping we could play nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.60,0:38:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们非得知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you must know…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.59,0:39:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里要建科研中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}…it's going to be a research center.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.90,0:39:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,研究啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Research for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.56,0:39:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,疾病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.55,0:39:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生们 我们要在此地治愈癌症\N{\fnArial\fs30}This, gentlemen, is where we are going to cure cancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.90,0:39:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢着 这说不通啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. That doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.69,0:39:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪克·罗曼干嘛要治愈癌症呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, why would Dick Roman want to cure cancer?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.94,0:39:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就是来普度苍生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause we're only here to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.12,0:39:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪物治疗癌症\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monsters cure cancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.28,0:39:40.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,真没想到我会说这话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something I never though I'd say.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.54,0:39:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,真让我不安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always make me so nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.00,0:39:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不是嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.77,0:39:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what do we do now.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.66,0:39:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要睡一觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna sleep on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.40,0:39:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直睡到我们到弗兰克那里 懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the way to Frank's. Capture?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.17,0:39:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倒想睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.93,0:39:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你昨晚睡了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you get any sleep last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.13,0:39:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡了 一小觉吧 说不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, a little, I-I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.85,0:40:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你调个温和点的摇滚音乐台\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we'll find you a soft-rock station.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.93,0:40:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,一听就睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always knocks you right out.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.72,0:40:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.95,0:40:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,德弗罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deveraux!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.84,0:40:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在里面干嘛呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is he doing in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.44,0:40:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.60,0:41:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,别开枪 我们要进去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't shoot! We're coming in!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.61,0:41:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不妙啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not good.
